    the supplier holds proof of delivery for the depth shoes.
    the supplier assessed the fit of the depth shoes at delivery with Ann wearing it.
    pay expects answers [].
    rn expects answers ["claim 1 is reasonable and necessary"].
    stage expects answers ["the query fails at remedy"].
    flip expects changes [["add: the certification statement for Ann is signed by the certifying physician"]].

