    the diagnosis code of Kim is "E11.42".
    the medical record of Kim documents poor circulation.
    the certifying physician of Kim is doctor of medicine.
    the certifying physician treats Kim under a comprehensive plan of care for diabetes.
    the certifying physician certified that Kim needs diabetic shoes.
    the prescribing practitioner for the insert is podiatrist.
    the supplier conducted an in-person evaluation of the feet of Kim with measurements before selecting the insert.
    the count of pairs of inserts furnished to Kim in the calendar year of claim 1 is 1.
